"Every session of the account on every device ends at its next request, "
"including sessions with \"Stay signed in\". The account can log in again "
"(with its second factor, if it has one). Use this when a device or a session"
" may have got into the wrong hands."
msgstr ""
"Chaque session du compte, sur chaque appareil, prend fin à sa prochaine "
"requête, y compris les sessions avec « Rester connecté ». Le compte peut se "
